#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The B<getservent>()  function reads the next entry from the services "
"database (see B<services>(5))  and returns a I<servent> structure containing "
"the broken-out fields from the entry.  A connection is opened to the "
"database if necessary."
msgstr ""
"La función B<getservent>() lee la siguiente línea de la base de datos de "
"servicios (consulte B<services>(5)) y devuelve una estructura I<servent> que "
"contiene en sus campos los campos de la línea.  Si es necesario, se abre una "
"conexión a la base de datos"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The B<getservbyname()> function returns a I<servent> structure for the "
#| "line from I</etc/services> that matches the service I<name> using "
#| "protocol I<proto>. If I<proto> is NULL, any protocol will be matched."
msgid ""
"The B<getservbyname>()  function returns a I<servent> structure for the "
"entry from the database that matches the service I<name> using protocol "
"I<proto>.  If I<proto> is NULL, any protocol will be matched.  A connection "
"is opened to the database if necessary."
msgstr ""
"La función B<getservbyname()> devuelve una estructura I<servent> conteniendo "
"los campos de la línea de I</etc/services> que contiene el servicio I<name> "
"y usa el protocolo I<proto>. Si I<proto> vale NULL, cualquier protocolo se "
"dará como válido."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The B<getservbyport>()  function returns a I<servent> structure for the "
"entry from the database that matches the port I<port> (given in network byte "
"order)  using protocol I<proto>.  If I<proto> is NULL, any protocol will be "
"matched.  A connection is opened to the database if necessary."
msgstr ""
"La función B<getservbyport>() devuelve una estructura de tipo I<servent> con "
"los datos de la línea que contiene el puerto I<port> (con los bytes en el "
"orden de red) y usa el protocolo I<proto>.  Si I<proto> vale NULL, cualquier "
"protocolo se dará como válido. Si necesarios, se abrirá una conexión con la "
"base de datos."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The B<setservent>()  function opens a connection to the database, and sets "
"the next entry to the first entry.  If I<stayopen> is nonzero, then the "
"connection to the database will not be closed between calls to one of the "
"B<getserv*>()  functions."
msgstr ""
"La función B<setservent>() abre una conexión con la base de datos y define "
"la siguiente entrada como la primera.  Si I<stayopen> es distinto de cero, "
"entonces no se cerrará la conexión a la base de datos entre llamadas a las "
"funciones B<getserv*>()."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "The B<endservent>()  function closes the connection to the database."
msgstr "La función B<endservent>() cierra la conexión a la base de datos."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "The I<servent> structure is defined in I<E<lt>netdb.hE<gt>> as follows:"
msgstr ""
"La estructura I<servent> está definida en I<E<lt>netdb.hE<gt>> como sigue:"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"struct servent {\n"
"    char  *s_name;       /* official service name */\n"
"    char **s_aliases;    /* alias list */\n"
"    int    s_port;       /* port number */\n"
"    char  *s_proto;      /* protocol to use */\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"struct servent {\n"
"    char  *s_name;       /* nombre oficial del servicio */\n"
"    char **s_aliases;    /* lista de alias */\n"
"    int    s_port;       /* número de puerto */\n"
"    char  *s_proto;      /* protocolo a usar */\n"
"}\n"

